    title: "When Should a Business Outsource Customer Support?",
    excerpt: "Understand the operational signs that customer support is ready to outsource and how to protect quality, brand voice, and visibility.",
    category: "Operations",
    date: "May 11, 2026",
    readTime: "8 min read",
